\chapter*{Abstract}
\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{Abstract}

This second volume of the AEGIS--Continuum Monograph series extends the
formal mathematical foundations established in Volume I. Here we
develop higher-order tensor operators, multi-field generalizations,
nonlinear curvature couplings, extended invariants, and global
existence/uniqueness results for the spectral-field evolution equation.
The work deepens the theoretical structure of the AEGIS--Continuum
framework and prepares the foundation for computational and experimental
volumes.

